flowchart TD
  W0["Onda 0: Desktop OS & Shell<br/>PV-001..PV-007<br/>Homepage, Janelas, Menus, Atalhos, Display"] --> W1["Onda 1: Product Analytics<br/>PV-008..PV-016<br/>Insights, Funis, Retenção, Trends, SQL HogQL, Dashboards"]
