  W4 --> W5["Onda 5: Data Warehouse<br/>PV-039..PV-044<br/>Conectores S3/BigQuery, Modelagem, Queries Unificadas, Sync"]
  W5 --> W6["Onda 6: AI Observability & Errors<br/>PV-045..PV-051<br/>Traces LLM, Prompts, Tokens, Error Tracking, Logs"]
